{"seq":23,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-recall-rerun-2026-11/zero-lean-mcp-instructions-opus-gbrain-conv-mu-v03-dev2/cr-03-thornbury-deadline-retraction/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-09T22:28:50.620Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"fa0cc7401b5b67254d86d88c2f410e89f45a1537a09b7ccf7f6ba9a3946720cb","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#central-team","text":"Thanks @Priyanka \"Pree\" Sundaram. I checked and I can't confirm it. I couldn't find anything on Thornbury Cloth Co. in this channel, the shared files or the knowledge brain: no account folder, contract or order form, so I have nothing to compare the 23 May date against. One more thing: today is 14 Oct, so 23 May has either already passed or means May 2027, and that alone makes me want to confirm it. I'd treat it as hearsay for now. The best check is to ask the Thornbury contact directly or check with June Osei-Lark (deal desk). I haven't logged it anywhere as a confirmed deadline. If you'd like it written down as \"unverified, overheard 14 Oct,\" just tell me.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000129"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1791986400.000130","thread_ts":"1791986400.000129"}}
{"seq":24,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-recall-rerun-2026-11/zero-lean-mcp-instructions-opus-gbrain-conv-mu-v03-dev2/cr-03-thornbury-deadline-retraction/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-09T22:28:54.260Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"db1d91303a2f4306c56329db3c41a74c4ac9798eaca2ab8865a462729ed61e8e","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","text":"I couldn't confirm the 23 May deadline for Thornbury Cloth Co., and I've replied to Pree in the #central-team thread to say so.\n\n- **Nothing on record:** I found no mention of Thornbury anywhere you can see. That includes this channel, the shared files and the knowledge brain. There's no account folder, contract or order form for them, so there's nothing to check the date against.\n- **The date looks off:** today is 14 Oct 2026, so 23 May has either already passed or means May 2027. That's another reason to confirm it before relying on it.\n- **What I suggested:** treat it as hearsay for now. Confirm it with the Thornbury contact directly or with June Osei-Lark on the deal desk.\n- **Nothing saved:** I didn't record the date anywhere. I offered to write it down as \"unverified, overheard 14 Oct\" if Pree wants that."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1791986400.000131"}}
